5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm glad we're doing this. I want us all to get along, so let's find a fair way to fix the bins! I'll start by looking into the Ward complaint log for this point.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see everyone gathered here. I want us all to feel comfortable in our own homes. I think I will look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree we need a sustainable solution. I will look into the Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the truck arrival time from the crew leader to understand the operational side.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if it's actually fair for everyone! I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses. Let's make sure nobody is doing all the work!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our solution is grounded in reality and kindness, I shall look into the Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Since I already picked the complaint log, I'll also check the statements at the residents' meeting. I want to know what everyone has been saying so we can all be happy!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I believe I have chosen my two areas of interest, dear Kenji. I shall stick with the supervised mornings and the bin house visit. I hope they provide some gentle guidance for us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I've already got my two! I'm super curious about those measurements and the money stuff. I hope we find out if things have been unfair for a long time!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I have also made my selections. I believe understanding our past expenditures will help us move forward with a spirit of harmony and fairness for every household.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I think we've all picked some great things to check! I'm really excited to see what we find out. Do you think the information will help us all feel better about each other?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe it will, dear Kenji. When we understand each other's perspectives and the reality of the situation, it is much easier to find a path that brings peace to everyone's heart.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Information is only useful if it leads to a practical, manageable system. I hope the data we gather allows us to create a structure that doesn't rely on the goodwill of a few individuals.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Exactly! We can't just hope people are nice. We need a real plan that's fair for everyone, even the people who have had to deal with the bins right at their front door!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience and clarity are our best allies. By combining Asuka's practicality with Rin's desire for fairness, we shall find a balance that respects both the budget and the spirit of our community.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree! Let's all do our best to find a solution that makes everyone smile. I can't wait to hear what you all discover! See you in the next round!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. Let us all approach this with kindness and an open heart. I look forward to hearing what you all find. Until then, please take care of yourselves.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I look forward to the results. Let's ensure we focus on the actual time and effort required for maintenance once we have the facts. See you all soon.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the adventure! I'll be looking for the truth in those numbers. See you all later! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,May we all find the wisdom to see beyond the numbers and recognize the human needs they represent. I wish you all a peaceful interval. Until we meet again.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
